    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Imperialis Fleet",
    "summary": "As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, choose one policy until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts. Eliminate At All Costs marks a single enemy on the board. Your AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM models get +1 to hit it. For Acquire At All Costs, designate one of the board’s objective markers. Your AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM models gain a 5+ invulnerable save and improve Leadership and Objective Control by 1 while their unit is in range of that marker.",
